The major homepage long task is now substantially improved.

The remaining homepage blocker is primarily **LCP/render delay**, not TBT.

The LCP remains the hero `<h1>`.

### New profiling utility

Retained:

```text
scripts/profile-homepage-cpu.mjs
```

It:

- captures Chrome CPU samples;
- source-maps samples when profiling source maps are present;
- writes reports under untracked `artifacts/`.

