# 3. Inspect hero rendering code

Inspect the homepage hero and its ancestor components for:

- entrance animations;
- opacity/transform transitions;
- animation delays;
- initially hidden text;
- CSS classes that transition from hidden to visible;
- JavaScript-driven reveal state;
- `useEffect`-driven visibility;
- delayed class application;
