The remaining blocker is no longer code architecture; it is supplying legitimate local runtime inputs:

- real viewer OAuth storage state;
- real submitter OAuth storage state;
- real admin OAuth storage state;
- an accessible API base for representative-ID discovery.

Implemented helpers:

```text
scripts/capture-lighthouse-auth-state.mjs
scripts/lighthouse-representatives.mjs
```

OAuth state capture commands:

```bash
npm.cmd run lighthouse:auth -- --role viewer
npm.cmd run lighthouse:auth -- --role submitter
npm.cmd run lighthouse:auth -- --role admin
```

Expected local artifact paths:

```text
artifacts/lighthouse/auth/viewer-storage-state.json
artifacts/lighthouse/auth/submitter-storage-state.json
artifacts/lighthouse/auth/admin-storage-state.json
