These files must remain ignored and must not be committed.

Role verification requires:

- exact `/auth/me` role match;
- successful protected-route load:
  - viewer -> `/account/overview`
  - submitter -> `/submissions/batches`
  - admin -> `/admin`

Representative data is resolved once per run through `scripts/lighthouse-representatives.mjs`.

Public IDs can be discovered automatically when either:

```text
