```

or the applicable existing API-base environment is available.

Protected/detail overrides remain supported for values such as:

```text
LIGHTHOUSE_SUBMISSION_BATCH_ID
LIGHTHOUSE_REVIEW_BATCH_ID
LIGHTHOUSE_API_CONSUMER_ID
```

plus public representative IDs/versions where needed.

